 ],
 "strings": {
  "Agreed. Anyway,\nI'm gonna head back to the office.": "",
  "Agreed. Anyway, that's enough for one night.\nI'm gonna head back to the office.": "",
  "Cool. Later man.": "",
  "Sure.\nLater, man.": "",
  "Look, I need to close up shop,  so you mind getting\noutta here? Not that you should've come to begin with.": "",
  "Come on, get out already. We're closing up.\nYou shouldn't have come to begin with.": "",
  "Yagami-san.\nUm, this is Saori.": "",
  "Yagami-san.\nUm... it's Shirosaki.": "",
  "What's up, Saori-san?\nYou don't usually call me...": "",
  "What do you mean, he's dead?": "",
  "Wh... What do you mean, dead?": "",
  "Didn't you just say everything\nwould be okay?": "",
  "Shintani-sensei's...? Yagami-san,\nyou said everything was fine—": "",
  "Stay calm, Saori-san.\nI'm just as shocked as you.": "",
  "Listen, Saori-san.\nI'm still trying to process this myself.": "",
  "But... I think the Mole is responsible.": "",
  "Have you contacted the police?": "",
  "You should do that right away, then...": "",
  "Okay... You should do that\nright away, then...": "",
  "Wait.": "",
  "Do you think you could\nmake the call, Saori-san?": "",
  "Can you... make the call\nfor me, Saori-san?": "",
  "I need time to check things out\nbefore the cops show up and take over.": "",
  "I just... wanna investigate as much as I can\nbefore the cops show up.": "",
  "Please.": "",
  "...Yeah, okay.": "",
  "...I understand.": "",
  "I appreciate it.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(His eyes are gouged out.\nSame as all the Mole's other victims.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(No blood on the floor.\nThe murder must have happened somewhere else.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(A bullet hole?)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(That must be the cause of death.\nBut that's not the Mole's usual MO...)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Hm, what about Shintani's phone?\nMight be a good place to look.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(It was going off when I called him earlier,\nso it's definitely on his body.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Quickest way to find it would be calling it again.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(The ringtone'll lead me straight to it.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(All right... Here we go.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Hm. Just have to listen close,\nsee where it's coming from.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(There it is!)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Shintani's phone.\nI should take a closer look.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(A black cat...\nI'm not superstitious, but...)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Shintani was in here. Maybe his phone's here too?)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(...Nope, no phone.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Sounds like the vibration is coming from... the body?)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(I should check it a little more closely.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Maybe it's under the chair?)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Nope.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(What about under the table?)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Shoot. Not here.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Is it under the sofa?)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Nope, don't see it.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(His call history should tell\nme everything I need to know.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Most of these are to Genda's office.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(All of them except... the last number he called.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Shintani called it just a few hours before his death.\nWho was he talking to?)</color>": "",
  "We received a call\nfrom the Genda Law Office.": "",
  "I'm here about a report\nfrom the Genda Law Office.": "",
  "You got here fast, Detective Kuroiwa.": "",
  "I didn't think you'd get here\nso quick, Officer Kuroiwa.": "",
  "Shintani, huh?": "",
  "His name has been coming up a lot lately.\nHe's the reason Hamura walked, after all.": "",
  "He's been coming up a lot lately.\nHe's the reason Hamura walked, after all.": "",
  "Perhaps... you couldn't stand his newfound fame,\nso you offed him?": "",
  "I see. Got too popular for you,\nso you offed him?": "",
  "I heard you two weren't\nexactly on good terms.": "",
  "I hear you two weren't on good terms, either.": "",
  "Do you greet everyone by\naccusing them of murder?": "",
  "Nice. Jump to murder accusations\nbefore you even say hello.": "",
  "Guess that's just how cops like you operate.": "",
  "Forensics will be here soon.": "",
  "...Forensics will be here soon.": "",
  "We will need you present as a resident of the property.\nAfter that, we'll need some time to investigate.": "",
  "You need to be present as a resident of the property.\nWe'll need time to investigate after that.": "",
  "How long?": "",
  "How long are we talking?": "",
  "You'll have to find somewhere else\nto stay tonight, at the very least.": "",
  "You'll need other accommodations\nfor tonight, at least.": "",
  "I don't have money for that...": "",
  "I don't have the money for that...": "",
  "Yet you can afford bribing a cop?": "",
  "Yet you have the cash\nto spare on bribing a cop?": "",
  "Ayabe's sources aren't even that reliable.": "",
  "Ayabe's intel isn't always accurate.": "",
  "Don't know what you mean.": "",
  "Don't know what you're talking about.": "",
  "Oh, I'm sure you do.": "",
  "Listen. Don't underestimate the police.": "",
  "Yeah, sorry. I had to wait around\nfor the cops to get here.": "",
  "...Yeah. I had to wait around\nfor the cops to get here.": "",
  "Is Genda-sensei still at the office?": "",
  "Yes. He wants to talk to you\nabout Shintani.": "",
  "As do I.\nHoshino, too.": "",
  "Okay, I'll head over now.": "",
  "Okay. I'll head over now.": "",
  "See you soon.": "",
  "I know you've had a rough night, Yagami... But if you're\nup to it, can you tell us what happened to Shintani?": "",
  "You've had a rough night, Yagami... but if you're up to it,\ncan you tell us what happened with Shintani?": "",
  "Saori-san was having trouble getting\nin touch with Shintani.": "",
  "...Shintani-sensei wasn't answering any calls.": "",
  "So I decided to give him a call myself,\nsee what the deal was.": "",
  "At least, not from Saori-san.\nSo I thought I'd give him a call myself.": "",
  "But when I dialed him up...\nI heard the phone ringing in my closet.": "",
  "Shintani was killed the same way\nas all the others.": "",
  "I found Shintani.\nJust like the Mole's other victims.": "",
  "The others?\nDo you mean his eyes were...": "",
  "It looked like the Mole's work?\nYou mean Shintani-sensei's eyes were...?": "",
  "Gouged out, yeah.": "",
  "Yeah. Gouged out.": "",
  "But Shintani's beef was with the Kyorei Clan.\nWhy would the Mole target him?": "",
  "But the Kyorei were the ones after him.\nThere was no reason for the Mole to target him.": "",
  "I'm not so sure... It sounded like he knew\nsomething when you talked earlier.": "",
  "But Shintani-sensei... He sounded like he knew something\nearlier today, right?": "",
  "Think this is some kind of yakuza pissing contest, do you?\nCome on! The Mole is way bigger than you know!": "",
  "You think this is just some yakuza dispute?\nThe Mole is bigger than any of that shit!": "",
  "He probably knew more about the Mole than I did.\nAnd his source had to have been Hamura.": "",
  "So he knew something about the Mole that I didn't.\nI'd guess... he heard something from Hamura.": "",
  "Maybe they killed him to keep their secret safe.": "",
  "But... why did he have to put\nShintani-sensei's body in your office?": "",
  "But, um... Why would the Mole have put Shintani-sensei...\nThat is, put his body in your office?": "",
  "Not sure.": "",
  "Maybe to harass me,\nmaybe to scare me off their trail. Maybe both.": "",
  "Maybe to harass me, maybe to scare me\noff their trail. Maybe both.": "",
  "You might wanna lay low for a bit.\nIt's not safe for you here.": "",
  "Get outta town, go somewhere quiet.": "",
  "If the Mole comes after you next...": "",
  "Right. I'll do just that, Genda-sensei.": "",
  "Makes sense.\nI'll do just that, Genda-sensei.": "",
  "Y'know, I watched over Shintani\nsince his first day as a lawyer.": "",
  "...I've been watching over Shintani\nsince his first day.": "",
  "Kid had a good head on his shoulders.\nAnd a knack for the job I could never compete with.": "",
  "But he didn't have the guts to succeed when push came\nto shove. Not the most persistent lawyer I've seen.": "",
  "But... he didn't have the guts when push came to shove.\nNot the most persistent lawyer I've seen.": "",
  "Even so, he looked up to me.": "",
  "Guess I took it for granted.\nThought he'd always be part of the team.": "",
  "Figured he'd always be part of the team here.\nTook him for granted.": "",
  "When I first joined, Shintani-sensei was the one\nwho showed me the ropes. He was a reliable man.": "",
  "When I first started working here, it was Shintani-sensei\nwho showed me the ropes of the job. He was my senpai.": "",
  "Or so you thought, right?": "",
  "Thanks for this, Yagami.": "",
  "Come on, Saori-kun.\nI'll walk you to the station.": "",
  "Saori-kun... come on.\nI'll walk you to the station.": "",
  "Feel free to stay here tonight, Yagami.": "",
  "Feel free to stay here tonight.": "",
  "What about you, Hoshino-kun?": "",
  "And you, Hoshino-kun?": "",
  "I think I'll work a little more\nbefore I head home.": "",
  "If you say so. G'night.": "",
  "If you say so.\nWell... 'Night.": "",
  "Good night, Boss.": "",
  "Good night.": "",
  "(I need to go tell Genda-sensei\nwhat happened to Shintani...)": "",
  "Make yourself at home, Yagami-san.\nI'll leave you the key.": "",
  "Make yourself at home, Yagami-san.\nHere, I'll even leave the key for you.": "",
  "You've been here way longer anyway.\nYou deserve it more than me.": "",
  "You've been here way longer than I have, anyway.\nYou ought to have it.": "",
  "Are you going out, Yagami-san?": "",
  "...Yeah?": "",
  "...Hm?": "",
  "There's, um...\nsomething I need to talk to you about.": "",
  "Just, um... It can wait if you're busy, but\nthere's something I want to talk to you about.": "",
  "Uh, it can wait until you get back though.": "",
  "Ah, but don't let me keep you.": "",
  "Um, Yagami-san...\nDo you have a minute?": "",
  "Ah... Do you have a minute?\nI'd like to speak with you privately.": "",
  "Sure, what's up?": "",
  "Sure. What's up?": "",
  "Well, it's about Shintani-sensei...": "",
  "Yes, well... it's about Shintani-sensei...": "",
  "In a bit, okay?": "",
  "Yagami-san, about what you said earlier...": "",
  "I know you just told Genda-sensei\nyou're gonna lay low...": "",
  "I know you told Genda-sensei\nyou're going to lay low...": "",
  "But that's not true, is it?\nYou want to keep hunting down this killer.": "",
  "But you're just going to keep looking\nfor the Mole, right?": "",
  "And if I said yes?": "",
  "And what if I am?": "",
  "Don't worry, I won't tell Genda-sensei.\nBut in return...": "",
  "I want to help you.\nLook for the Mole, that is.": "",
  "Can I help out too?\nLooking for the Mole, that is.": "",
  "I won't slow you down, I promise.": "",
  "I won't slow you down,\nI promise! So...": "",
  "Looking to avenge Shintani, huh?": "",
  "Don't tell me... you're looking to\navenge Shintani?": "",
  "He wasn't as strong as he let on. The tough guy act\nwas a mask he wore to hide his insecurities.": "",
  "You know... He only acted tough or arrogant to cover up his\ninsecurities. He was less confident than he let on.": "",
  "Deep down, he was just... weak. ": "",
  "He was always trying to hide\nhow weak he was.": "",
  "That's why he was going along with Hamura.\nNot because he wanted to.": "",
  "That's why he was in with Captain Hamura.\nNot because he wanted to.": "",
  "I mean, who can say no to a yakuza...?": "",
  "He couldn't stand up to a yakuza, y'know?": "",
  "And now look how it turned out.": "",
  "I was sitting right next to him this whole time...\nYet there was nothing I could do to help.": "",
  "The whole time, I just sat right next to him...\nand there was nothing I could do to help.": "",
  "You know, I'm still young, I don't even know\nwhat kind of lawyer I want to be.": "",
  "Really, I can't do much... I don't even know\nwhat kind of lawyer I want to be.": "",
  "Criminal, civil...\nNot the slightest idea.": "",
  "But I know one thing. I don't want to be the kind of lawyer\nwho sits on his hands after his friend gets murdered.": "",
  "But if there's one thing I do know...  I'm not a lawyer\nwho sits on his hands after his friend gets murdered.": "",
  "Which means...": "",
  "So...": "",
  "Are you sure about this, Hoshino?\nGenda-sensei told me to lay low.": "",
  "You sure about this?\nGenda-sensei already slapped my wrist.": "",
  "If you're seen helping me...": "",
  "If you're seen helping me... ": "",
  "Don't worry about that.": "",
  "I'll defend myself in court if I need to.": "",
  "Now, Yagami-san.": "",
  "Do you... mind if I tag along?": "",
  "Is it okay? Can I tag along?": "",
  "You'll just tell Genda-sensei\nif I refuse, huh?": "",
  "You'll just tell Genda-sensei if I refuse, huh?": "",
  "...Yeah! Sorry, though.": "",
  "Not much choice, then.\nWelcome aboard.": "",
  "Well, not much choice.\nSure, welcome aboard.": "",
  "Glad to be working with you.": "",
  "The pleasure's mine.": "",
  "Well, let's get down to business.  First off,\nI wanna know what Shintani was doing before he died.": "",
  "Now, first we need to investigate what\nShintani was doing before he died.": "",
  "And I have some evidence\nthat may tell us just that.": "",
  "And I have some evidence that\nmay tell us just that.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(I should have something that hints at\nwhat Shintani was doing before he died.)</color>": "",
  "I managed to take this\nbefore the cops showed up.": "",
  "I took this before the cops showed up.": "",
  "Yeah that's...\nShintani-sensei alright.": "",
  "That's... Shintani-sensei, isn't it.": "",
  "I'm not sure what this tells us about\nwhat he was doing before the murder.": "",
  "But... I'm not sure what this tells us about\nhis actions before the murder.": "",
  "Hm? Oh, right. My bad.": "",
  "Hm? Really? Uh...\nWell, never mind.": "",
  "If we wanna know what Shintani\nwas up to before he got killed...": "",
  "We need a clue... one that'll show us\nwhat Shintani did before his death.": "",
  "This might be just what we need.": "",
  "Shintani dialed this number earlier today.": "",
  "Look. Shintani dialed this number\nearlier today.": "",
  "I wanna know where it goes.": "",
  "And I'm wondering,\nwho's on the other end?": "",
  "Right, that makes sense.": "",
  "It's a good thing the killer forgot\nto take Shintani's phone, huh?": "",
  "I guess we got lucky, huh?\nThe killer must've forgotten to take his phone.": "",
  "This way we can see who he was calling.": "",
  "Now we've got a trail we can follow.": "",
  "The killer didn't forget. Even if the phone was gone,\nwe'd still be able to get Shintani's data from his provider.": "",
  "No, they didn't forget. Even if the phone was gone,\nwe could get Shintani's data from his provider.": "",
  "Really? I had no idea.": "",
  "Yup. I'd bet he left the phone so I'd find the body quicker.": "",
  "I'd say... the Mole specifically left the phone\nso I'd find the body quicker.": "",
  "Huh...?": "",
  "I mean, he went through the trouble of hiding\nit in my office of all places.": "",
  "I mean, he went through the trouble of\nhiding it in my office of all places.": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "Wait.": "เดี๋ยว.",
  "Please.": "เชิญเลย",
  "...Yeah, okay.": "...เข้าใจแล้วครับ",
  "I appreciate it.": "ขอบคุณครับ",
  "...Yeah?": "...ครับ?",
  "...Hm?": "...หืม?",
  "Sure, what's up?": "ได้สิ มีอะไรเหรอ?",
  "Sure. What's up?": "ได้สิ มีอะไรเหรอ?",
  "And what if I am?": "แล้วถ้าใช่ล่ะ?",
  "Which means...": "ซึ่งหมายความว่า...",
  "So...": "เอาเป็นว่า...",
  "Really? I had no idea.": "จริงเหรอ?\nไม่รู้เลยแฮะ",
  "Huh...?": "หา...?"
 }
}
